p widgets",tooltip:"Embed a feedback and Updates widget on your website to more seamlessly collect feedback and share updates with your users.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/en/articles/3948450-what-are-in-app-widgets",img:"/images/onboarding/feedback-widgets.jpg"},{name:"Up to 5 categories & roadmaps",tooltip:"Create up to 5 categories and roadmaps for different topics or products.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/en/articles/1421183-set-up-feedback-boards"},{name:"Unlimited help center articles",tooltip:"Create as many help center articles as you need to support your customers.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app"},{name:"AI request suggestions",tooltip:"Our AI suggests similar requests to users when posting and gives you an overview of duplicate requests when viewing a request.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/articles/6974491-merging-duplicate-posts",img:"/images/features/ai-suggestions-large.jpg"},{name:"Request & comment moderation",tooltip:"New requests and comments won't be visible on the Feedback Portal before you approve them.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/en/articles/6982593-post-and-comment-moderation",img:"https://fb-usercontent.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0191341e-7ade-75c0-b112-eb80c92fdea7.png"},{name:"3 surveys",tooltip:"Create up to 3 targeted surveys (NPS, CSAT, etc.) to gather feedback from your users.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/articles/0183532-targeting-and-segmenting-surveys"},{name:"Core integrations",tooltip:"Integrate with popular tools like Intercom, Linear, Jira, Discord, Slack, and more.",url:"https://help.featurebase.app/en/articles/7017609-intercom-integration"},{name:"API, Webhooks & MCP",tooltip:"Connect your product and AI tools to Featurebase using API v2, real-time webhooks, and MCP.",url:"https://developers.featurebase.app/api"},{name:"5,000 emails/month & Unlimited with flex pricing",tooltip:"Your first 5,000 outbound emails each month are free. Additional usage is billed with tiered pricing.",url:"https: